        <div><span class="trail-number">01</span><h3>Flora & pollinator walk</h3><p>Look closely at seasonal wildflowers, grasses, shrubs, butterflies, bees and the relationships that hold this dry landscape together.</p><span class="trail-detail">Best for · naturalists, macro photography, gentle exploration</span></div>
      </article>
